; Callers (2 JSR sites): Menu_Mode03H3 ($C2:B3DD) and Menu_Icon2Preview ($C2:B8F8).
; Entry: M any (P saved; SEP #$20 / REP #$30 here), X any (the LDX/LDY
;        come after the REP #$30), DP=$0000, DB=$7E (the multiplier and
